9);font-family: montserrat;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n             EL REFUGIO\n            </span>\n            ”\n           </strong>\n</span>\n          ，并开始在大约5.6公顷的土地上种植咖啡(最初种植的铁皮卡)。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          1982年，奥斯瓦尔多·佩雷斯去世，他的三个儿子马里奥·阿方索、马克斯·乔尔和奥斯瓦尔多·佩雷斯·拉米雷斯接管了农场。他们继续用新的、更好的技术种植咖啡，从而获得更高的产量，并试验了新的品种(卡蒂姆、卡杜艾和帕卡马拉)。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q5IrVl78oENAPK6XaF2KkExBa5CE2OJYxfMXmccc3tjztHPpCBTkDSNUvfYs3icjk1TQbX7APfU0g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 678px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          1992年，奥斯瓦尔多·佩雷斯·拉米雷斯(Oswaldo Perez Ramirez)从他的兄弟和邻近的农场手中买下了农场，建立了\n          <strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Finca\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<strong>\n          El Refugio\n         </strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          ，奥斯瓦尔多及兄弟拥有105公顷的咖啡面积和35公顷未开发的热带雨林。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          农场有自己的湿处理厂（脱皮与发酵处理）和干处理厂（脱壳），有150个常驻的工人。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          El Refugio名字是为了向在1850/60年代墨西哥战争时，收留从墨西哥借由危地马拉边境逃离过来的避难者的危地马拉人致敬而起的名字，也是对多山的危地马拉是绝佳的避难寓意。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          天佑庄园El Refugio，这个名字是为了纪念在1850/1860年代的墨西哥战争中幸免于难的人们。他们跨越了危地马拉的边境而免于被虏，并最终在那美丽的山脉中找到了天佑的避难之地。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 388px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
